Worldmap for Horizon 26.3 (version 0.3.1)

An original WebAssembly mod (the mod API only, no mixins), written from scratch under the MIT licence
(licence text in LICENSE). Built against Horizon's exact-build SDK 2b77287de099c9316278ba7ac4d83590fdb7ef30.

Inspired by Eternity World Map (https://github.com/qwinterxxx/horizon-eternity-world-map, MIT): the feature
set is similar; code from it may be reused with its notice kept here. The feature list of
Minimap-Worldmap-and-waypoints-reworked (GPL-3.0) was also an inspiration; none of its code was read or copied.
